# Namaz Vakitleri (Islamic Prayer Times) — Technical Analysis & Architecture Documentation

## Executive Summary

This document describes the **actual** architecture of the Namaz Vakitleri native Android application as it exists in the repository today. It supersedes earlier aspirational documentation that described components (Room, WorkManager, notifications, widgets) that were never implemented.

The app is built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose (Material Design 3), follows Clean Architecture with MVVM, and uses Koin for dependency injection. Prayer times are computed locally with the **adhan2** library and cached in a **Preferences DataStore**-backed cache — there is **no Room database**. There is currently **no WorkManager**, **no notification system**, and **no home-screen widgets**; prayer notifications are planned and are being added as part of the current development plan.

