## 14. Conclusion

Namaz Vakitleri is a modern, multi-module Android application built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Material Design 3, following Clean Architecture with MVVM and Koin DI. Prayer times are calculated locally with adhan2 and cached in a Preferences DataStore-backed cache. The app currently ships without background jobs, notifications, or widgets; these are planned work rather than existing functionality.

